# head/adult/man/oval: the man's Oval head (A3): the skull, the face, the eyes and the mouth; hair, brows, nose and ears are their own parts
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role head oval
layer head
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -2 -3
mark face 1 5
